  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0014_ec0c54cec2a7.jpg\" style=\"width: 167px; height: 130px;\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0014_8ace5df56ef8.jpg\" style=\"height: 134px; width: 200px;\" /><br /><br />The friction force on coin just before coin is to slip will be : <math> <mrow> <mtext>f</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mi>μ</mi> <mtext>s</mtext> </msub> <mtext>mg</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />Normal reaction on the coin ; N = mg<br />The resultant reaction by disk to the coin is<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <msup> <mtext>N</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>f</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </msqrt> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>mg</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi>μ</mi> <mtext>s</mtext> </msub> <mtext>mg</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </msqrt> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>mg</mtext> <msqrt> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <msubsup> <mi>μ</mi> <mtext>s</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msubsup> </msqrt> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>×</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mo>×</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mo>×</mo> <msqrt> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>9</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </msqrt> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>0.5 N</mtext> </mrow> </math>"
